{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Kassel just after eleven. The heat was oppressive, so I spent the day walking the town rather than seeking rest. The air here is thick, but the light is bright and clear. I have taken a room near the castle; the view is pleasant, and the service adequate.\n\nI am tired, but the change of scene does good. I find myself thinking less of the dense abstractions of the *Philosophy of Right* and more of the simple, living world. It is a necessary counterweight. I have bought a small bottle of local wine and a packet of snuff. I shall dine simply and sleep early.\n\nDo not worry for me. The journey is steady. I hope Karl and Immanuel are well and that the heat in Berlin is not too severe for you. I shall write again from Hanover, insha’Allah.\n\nYour loving husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080153,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":195,"prompt_tokens":915,"total_tokens":1110,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-UvkN11faJz7fP0UWnRxpf9lL8A3FWSro","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":915,"prompt_ms":905.239,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9893322404371585,"prompt_per_second":1010.7827877499755,"predicted_n":195,"predicted_ms":4601.315,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.71811855670103,"predicted_per_second":42.16186025081961}}